1
00:00:00,598 --> 00:00:02,968
(Sheldon:)What kind of person
leaves his keys in the car?

2
00:00:03,167 --> 00:00:05,197
(Leonard:)Thought we agreed
it's Koothrappali's fault.

3
00:00:05,436 --> 00:00:06,496
(Sheldon:)You're right.

4
00:00:06,904 --> 00:00:08,934
(Sheldon:)Nice going.

5
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,600
(Scene:)Car.

6
00:00:18,148 --> 00:00:20,278
(Raj:)What is wrong with people?
Why don't they stop?

7
00:00:20,451 --> 00:00:21,821
(Sheldon:)Maybe we're better off.

8
00:00:22,019 --> 00:00:24,719
(Sheldon:)What if we were to get in a car
with a crazy person?

9
00:00:24,955 --> 00:00:27,615
(Leonard:)Look at us, Sheldon.
We're the crazy people.

10
00:00:30,694 --> 00:00:33,454
(Sheldon:)Well, perhaps we should hold up a sign...

11
00:00:33,664 --> 00:00:37,294
(Sheldon:)...that assures passing motorists
of our mental competence.

12
00:00:38,636 --> 00:00:41,336
(Howard:)Good idea.
Why don't you get started on that?

13
00:00:42,973 --> 00:00:44,563
(Leonard:)Come on, let's just start walking.

14
00:00:44,808 --> 00:00:47,708
There's gotta be a gas station
or something nearby.

15
00:00:47,945 --> 00:00:51,675
(Sheldon:)What, you think just because you're wearing
a captain's uniform you're in charge?

16
00:00:52,082 --> 00:00:53,672
(Leonard:)Yes.

17
00:00:54,351 --> 00:01:06,021
(Penny:)All right.

